I fetch the food from the kitchen.
I put a large bowl of potato salad on the table.
Afterwards, I bring the warm Bouletten.
Timo and Lena look very impressed.
"That smells fantastic, Maya!" says Lena.
"Thank you very much!" I answer.
"Please, take some!" I say to my friends.
"Take the potato salad first and then try the Bouletten."
Timo takes two Bouletten and a lot of salad.
He tries the food and smiles.
"That is really typical Berlin!" he says.
Lena nods and also eats a piece of Boulette.
"How much meat is that?" she asks.
"Half a kilo," I explain.
"And two tablespoons of mustard."
We open the beer.
"Cheers!" says Timo, and we clink glasses.
"To the cook!" Lena adds.
We drink and talk together the whole evening.
I am very happy about this success.
